INT. STARSHIP BRIDGE - ALERT

Red light. Klaxons. Six crew at six stations.

CAPTAIN VESNA OKORO, 50s, grips the command rail.
HELMSMAN DAVOR PETROSYAN, 30s, hammers a console.
ENGINEER LOLA MBEKI-HART, 40s, hangs half out of a panel.
MEDIC TARIQ SANDOVAL, 30s, braces against a wall.
COMMS OFFICER YUKI ABERNATHY, 20s, presses a headset to her ear.
And NAVIGATOR BRIDGET FAIRLEY-ONUOHA, 50s, who stares at the star map.

VESNA
Report!

DAVOR
Thrusters dead!

LOLA
Core's venting!

TARIQ
We've got breach on deck four!

YUKI
Captain, they're hailing!

VESNA
Ignore it!

BRIDGET
Captain, if I may--

DAVOR
We're drifting!

LOLA
Fifteen seconds to cascade!

YUKI
They're asking for surrender!

TARIQ
Is anyone on four?

BRIDGET
Captain!

VESNA
(shouting over them all)
Quiet!

Silence. Only the klaxon.

She turns to Bridget. Bridget points at the map.

BRIDGET
There's a gas giant. Eleven minutes away. We can slingshot.

VESNA
Davor?

DAVOR
No thrust.

LOLA
I can give you one burst.

VESNA
Then give it.

Lola slams a lever. The ship shudders. Stars wheel.

The klaxon dies. Six faces turn to the main screen, where a vast banded planet swells.

VESNA (CONT'D)
(softly)
Hold on.
